B.bLv=new A.e("MUCIZE-0086","Ay\u0131n eski hurma dal\u0131 gibi evreleri","Astronomi ve kozmoloji mucizeleri",u.G,"Yasin 36:39","\u0643\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064f\u0631\u0652\u062c\u064f\u0648\u0646\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u062f\u0650\u064a\u0645\u0650","Ay\u0131n hilal evreleri ve y\xf6r\xfcnge g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc","g\xf6zlemsel i\u015faret",u.tx,B.pg,B.kj)
B.pb=new A.p("Kaynakta dikkat \xe7eken \xe7ekirdek ifade: \u0627\u0644\u0634\u064e\u0651\u0645\u0652\u0633\u064e \u0636\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0627\u0621\u064b \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0642\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0631\u064e \u0646\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064b\u0627. Bu ifade Yunus 10:5; Furkan 25:61 ba\u011flam\u0131nda de\u011ferlendirilir. Mucize iddias\u0131n\u0131n oda\u011f\u0131 \u015fudur: G\xfcne\u015fin \u0131\u015f\u0131k kayna\u011f\u0131, ay\u0131n yans\u0131t\u0131c\u0131 olu\u015fu \u015feklinde yorumlan\u0131r. \u0130nsan g\xf6zlemledi\u011fi olay\u0131n arka plan\u0131ndaki d\xfczeni \xe7o\u011fu zaman fark etmez. Kaynak metin, bu olay\u0131n arkas\u0131ndaki \xf6l\xe7\xfc, maksat ve s\xfcreklili\u011fe dikkat \xe7eker. Modern bilgiyle birlikte bak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ayn\u0131 olay \xe7ok daha derin g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr. Bu, vahyin do\u011fay\u0131 bilim kitab\u0131 gibi de\u011fil, tefekk\xfcr kitab\u0131 gibi okuttu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Bu kart\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc yapan \u015fey, kaynaktaki k\u0131sa ifadenin sadece tek d\xf6nemlik bir \xf6\u011f\xfct olmaktan \xe7\u0131k\u0131p, daha geni\u015f bir bilgi evrenine ba\u011flanabilmesidir. Okuyucu a\xe7\u0131s\u0131ndan etkileyici nokta, metnin ya bilimsel bir olguyla, ya tarih\xee bir geli\u015fmeyle, ya da say\u0131sal/dilsel bir d\xfczenle beklenmedik bi\xe7imde kesi\u015fmesidir. Bu ba\u015fl\u0131k kesin laboratuvar ispat\u0131 gibi de\u011fil, Kur'an/S\xfcnnet metni ile g\xf6zlem veya tarih aras\u0131ndaki dikkat \xe7ekici uyum olarak sunulmal\u0131d\u0131r.","\xc7\xfcnk\xfc ay \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve g\xfcne\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 ayr\u0131m\u0131 ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131, ilk bak\u0131\u015fta s\u0131radan g\xf6r\xfcnen bir ifade veya olay\u0131n arkas\u0131nda beklenmedik bir d\xfczen, haber, \xf6l\xe7\xfc veya bilimsel kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k bulundu\u011funu d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr. G\xf6zlem ile vahyin bulu\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6zellikle vurgulanmal\u0131d\u0131r. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 bu kart\u0131 okudu\u011funda yaln\u0131z 'bu ayet/hadis bunu s\xf6yl\xfcyor' bilgisini de\u011fil, 'bu ifade neden \xf6zellikle se\xe7ilmi\u015f olabilir?' sorusunu da g\xf6r\xfcr. Bu soru, mucize kart\u0131n\u0131n ana etkisini \xfcretir.",u.El,u.i)
