B.bFW=new A.e("MUCIZE-0395","Kemiklere et giydirilmesi",u.Z,u.V,"M\xfcminun 23:14","\u0641\u064e\u0643\u064e\u0633\u064e\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0639\u0650\u0638\u064e\u0627\u0645\u064e \u0644\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064b\u0627","\u0130skelet-kas geli\u015fim s\u0131ras\u0131 tart\u0131\u015fmas\u0131","embriyolojik i\u015faret",u._M,B.me,B.cU)
B.mf=new A.p("Kaynakta dikkat \xe7eken \xe7ekirdek ifade: \u0628\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0642\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u0631\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0623\u064e\u0646\u0652 \u0646\u064f\u0633\u064e\u0648\u0650\u0651\u064a\u064e \u0628\u064e\u0646\u064e\u0627\u0646\u064e\u0647\u064f. Bu ifade K\u0131yame 75:3-4 ba\u011flam\u0131nda de\u011ferlendirilir. Mucize iddias\u0131n\u0131n oda\u011f\u0131 \u015fudur: Parmak izlerinin benzersizli\u011fiyle ili\u015fkilendirilir. Arap\xe7a ifade k\u0131sa olmas\u0131na ra\u011fmen birden \xe7ok anlam katman\u0131n\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131r. K\xf6k, vezin, ba\u011flam ve c\xfcmle dizili\u015fi birlikte okundu\u011funda metin s\u0131radan bir c\xfcmle olmaktan \xe7\u0131kar. Bu yo\u011funluk, Kur'an'\u0131n belagat y\xf6n\xfcn\xfcn en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc par\xe7alar\u0131ndan biridir. Kart\u0131n amac\u0131, bu yo\u011funlu\u011fu uygulama kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n k\u0131sa s\xfcrede fark etmesini sa\u011flamakt\u0131r. Bu kart\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc yapan \u015fey, kaynaktaki k\u0131sa ifadenin sadece tek d\xf6nemlik bir \xf6\u011f\xfct olmaktan \xe7\u0131k\u0131p, daha geni\u015f bir bilgi evrenine ba\u011flanabilmesidir. Okuyucu a\xe7\u0131s\u0131ndan etkileyici nokta, metnin ya bilimsel bir olguyla, ya tarih\xee bir geli\u015fmeyle, ya da say\u0131sal/dilsel bir d\xfczenle beklenmedik bi\xe7imde kesi\u015fmesidir. Bu ba\u015fl\u0131k kesin laboratuvar ispat\u0131 gibi de\u011fil, Kur'an/S\xfcnnet metni ile g\xf6zlem veya tarih aras\u0131ndaki dikkat \xe7ekici uyum olarak sunulmal\u0131d\u0131r.","\xc7\xfcnk\xfc parmak u\xe7lar\u0131 ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131, ilk bak\u0131\u015fta s\u0131radan g\xf6r\xfcnen bir ifade veya olay\u0131n arkas\u0131nda beklenmedik bir d\xfczen, haber, \xf6l\xe7\xfc veya bilimsel kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k bulundu\u011funu d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr. Dilsel yo\u011funluk \xf6zellikle vurgulanmal\u0131d\u0131r. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 bu kart\u0131 okudu\u011funda yaln\u0131z 'bu ayet/hadis bunu s\xf6yl\xfcyor' bilgisini de\u011fil, 'bu ifade neden \xf6zellikle se\xe7ilmi\u015f olabilir?' sorusunu da g\xf6r\xfcr. Bu soru, mucize kart\u0131n\u0131n ana etkisini \xfcretir.",u.hS,u.i)
