B.cd4=new A.f("SOZ-0273","\u0130slam \xc2limleri & M\xfctefekkirler","Aliya \u0130zzetbegovi\xe7",u.IF,u.zY,u.vG,"g\xf6r\xfc\u015f_\xf6zeti","insan ve din","Do\u011fu ve Bat\u0131 Aras\u0131nda \u0130slam","Aliya \u0130zzetbegovi\xe7, D\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr ve devlet adam\u0131; Do\u011fu-Bat\u0131 aras\u0131nda \u0130slam'\u0131 yorumlad\u0131. Bu kartta verilen ifade 'Ak\u0131l ve hakikat' ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015finin i\xe7inde ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\xf6nem ve entelekt\xfcel \xe7evre, bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn etkisini art\u0131rm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc s\xf6z sadece ki\u015fisel bir inan\xe7 beyan\u0131 de\u011fil, kendi alan\u0131ndaki bir birikimin sonucudur. Bu s\xf6z, insan akl\u0131n\u0131n hakikate ula\u015fma kapasitesini g\xfcndeme getirir. E\u011fer ak\u0131l b\xfct\xfcn\xfcyle k\xf6r s\xfcre\xe7lerin yan \xfcr\xfcn\xfc say\u0131l\u0131rsa, hakikati buldu\u011funa g\xfcvenmek ayr\u0131ca a\xe7\u0131klama ister. Bu y\xfczden ak\u0131l, mant\u0131k ve bilginin g\xfcvenilirli\u011fi teistik d\xfc\u015f\xfcncede \xf6nemli bir pencere olarak ele al\u0131n\u0131r. Kart, \xf6zellikle Plantinga tipi arg\xfcmanlara ba\u011flanabilir. Bu kart uygulamada 'S\xf6zler' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na okunabilir; ayr\u0131ca deliller, mucizeler veya cevaplar b\xf6l\xfcmlerine ba\u011flant\u0131 verebilir. Do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131 olmayan maddeler \xf6zellikle 'g\xf6r\xfc\u015f \xf6zeti' diye i\u015faretlendi; Claude Code aray\xfcz\xfcnde bunlar\u0131 'S\xf6z\xfcn \xf6z\xfc' etiketiyle g\xf6stermek daha g\xfcvenlidir.",u.Bo,B.b1W)
