B.c5v=new A.f("SOZ-0855",u.X,"S\xf8ren Kierkegaard",u.uS,u.cT,"\u0130man\u0131n varolu\u015fsal derinli\u011fi","g\xf6r\xfc\u015f_\xf6zeti","iman","Fear and Trembling","S\xf8ren Kierkegaard, Varolu\u015f\xe7u d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr; iman s\u0131\xe7ray\u0131\u015f\u0131 ve birey vurgusuyla bilinir. Bu kartta verilen ifade 'Anlam ve \xf6l\xfcm' ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015finin i\xe7inde ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\xf6nem ve entelekt\xfcel \xe7evre, bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn etkisini art\u0131rm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc s\xf6z sadece ki\u015fisel bir inan\xe7 beyan\u0131 de\u011fil, kendi alan\u0131ndaki bir birikimin sonucudur. Bu s\xf6z/g\xf6r\xfc\u015f, insan\u0131n \xf6l\xfcm, fanilik ve anlam aray\u0131\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131ndaki durumunu anlat\u0131r. \u0130nsan sadece ya\u015famaz; ni\xe7in ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 da bilmek ister. Bu aray\u0131\u015f tarih boyunca edebiyattan felsefeye, siyasetten psikolojiye kadar bir\xe7ok alanda belirleyici olmu\u015ftur. Kart, f\u0131trat ve ebediyet arzusu delilleriyle ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r. Bu kart uygulamada 'S\xf6zler' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na okunabilir; ayr\u0131ca deliller, mucizeler veya cevaplar b\xf6l\xfcmlerine ba\u011flant\u0131 verebilir. Do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131 olmayan maddeler \xf6zellikle 'g\xf6r\xfc\u015f \xf6zeti' diye i\u015faretlendi; Claude Code aray\xfcz\xfcnde bunlar\u0131 'S\xf6z\xfcn \xf6z\xfc' etiketiyle g\xf6stermek daha g\xfcvenlidir.",u.O8,B.b8K)
