B.aC8=new A.h("Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Cosmological Argument; \u0130htira ve Hudus delili a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131",u.I,"Bu delil, evrenin ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131, geni\u015flemesi, yasalar\u0131 veya b\xfcy\xfck \xf6l\xe7ekli yap\u0131s\u0131 \xfczerinden a\xe7\u0131klama sorusu sorar. Kozmoloji bize evrenin nas\u0131l evrildi\u011fini g\xf6sterebilir; fakat evrenin ni\xe7in var oldu\u011fu ve ni\xe7in yasa ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131 daha temel bir sorudur. Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7, sonluluk veya ince ayar gibi noktalar, evrenin kendi kendine yeterli a\xe7\u0131klama olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 fikrini g\xfc\xe7lendirir. Teist yorumda evren, zorunlu ve a\u015fk\u0131n bir Yarat\u0131c\u0131\u2019ya ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn bir ger\xe7ekliktir. Bu nedenle \u201cTesels\xfcl\xfcn \u0130mk\xe2ns\u0131zl\u0131\u011f\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Sonsuz a\xe7\u0131klama zinciri, a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 s\xfcrekli erteler. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.apo=new A.d("DELIL-0008","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","Klasik arg\xfcmanlar","Tesels\xfcl\xfcn \u0130mk\xe2ns\u0131zl\u0131\u011f\u0131","Sonsuz a\xe7\u0131klama zinciri, a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 s\xfcrekli erteler.","Her a\xe7\u0131klama ba\u015fka bir a\xe7\u0131klamaya havale edilirse nihai cevap gelmez. Kel\xe2m ve felsefe gelene\u011finde sonsuz geri gidi\u015fin, \xf6zellikle varl\u0131k verme a\xe7\u0131s\u0131ndan, problemi \xe7\xf6zmedi\u011fi savunulur.",B.b4L,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.btw,B.aC8)
