B.ay7=new A.h("Edward Feser, Five Proofs of the Existence of God, Ignatius Press, 2017; Thomas Aquinas, Summa Theologiae, Five Ways","Kaynak zemini: Aquinas\u2019\u0131n Be\u015f Yolu; hareket, fail sebep, m\xfcmk\xfcn-zorunlu varl\u0131k, dereceler ve gaye \xfczerinden Tanr\u0131\u2019ya ula\u015f\u0131r.","Bu kart, fiziksel evrenin yaln\u0131zca var olmas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ve ya\u015fam\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn k\u0131lan bir d\xfczen i\xe7inde var olmas\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Sabitler, kuvvetler, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ko\u015fullar\u0131 ve enerji dengeleri k\xfc\xe7\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimlere duyarl\u0131 oldu\u011funda, \u201cneden b\xf6yle?\u201d sorusu g\xfc\xe7lenir. Do\u011fal a\xe7\u0131klamalar bu mekanizmalar\u0131 tasvir edebilir; fakat d\xfczenin nihai zemini ayr\u0131 bir felsefi sorudur. Teist yorum, bu uygunlu\u011fu ilim, kudret ve hikmet sahibi bir yarat\u0131\u015f\u0131n izi olarak okur. Bu nedenle \u201cThomist varl\u0131k-\xf6z ayr\u0131m\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Bir \u015feyin ne oldu\u011fu ile var oldu\u011fu ayn\u0131 \u015fey de\u011fildir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.afO=new A.d("DELIL-0397","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","Klasik metafizik","Thomist varl\u0131k-\xf6z ayr\u0131m\u0131","Bir \u015feyin ne oldu\u011fu ile var oldu\u011fu ayn\u0131 \u015fey de\u011fildir.","Aquinas \xe7izgisinde m\xfcmk\xfcn varl\u0131klar\u0131n \xf6z\xfc, onlar\u0131n var olmas\u0131n\u0131 garanti etmez. Bir varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n mahiyeti ile varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ayr\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsa, varl\u0131k akt\u0131n\u0131 alan bu \u015fey nihai olarak varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xf6z\xfcyle ayn\u0131 olan saf varl\u0131\u011fa dayan\u0131r.",B.b3S,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.b_N,B.ay7)
