B.aCN=new A.h("Edward Feser, Five Proofs of the Existence of God, Ignatius Press, 2017; G. W. Leibniz, Principle of Sufficient Reason and cosmological reasoning; Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Cosmological Argument",u.I,"Bu kart, fiziksel evrenin yaln\u0131zca var olmas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ve ya\u015fam\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn k\u0131lan bir d\xfczen i\xe7inde var olmas\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Sabitler, kuvvetler, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ko\u015fullar\u0131 ve enerji dengeleri k\xfc\xe7\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimlere duyarl\u0131 oldu\u011funda, \u201cneden b\xf6yle?\u201d sorusu g\xfc\xe7lenir. Do\u011fal a\xe7\u0131klamalar bu mekanizmalar\u0131 tasvir edebilir; fakat d\xfczenin nihai zemini ayr\u0131 bir felsefi sorudur. Teist yorum, bu uygunlu\u011fu ilim, kudret ve hikmet sahibi bir yarat\u0131\u015f\u0131n izi olarak okur. Bu nedenle \u201cRasyonalist yeter sebep savunusu\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Ger\xe7ekli\u011fin toplam\u0131 bile a\xe7\u0131klama ister. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.akb=new A.d("DELIL-0398","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","Klasik metafizik","Rasyonalist yeter sebep savunusu","Ger\xe7ekli\u011fin toplam\u0131 bile a\xe7\u0131klama ister.","Leibnizci-rasyonalist arg\xfcman, yaln\u0131z evrenin i\xe7indeki olaylar\u0131 de\u011fil, ger\xe7ekli\u011fin ni\xe7in var oldu\u011funu sorar. Cevap, a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131n\u0131 d\u0131\u015far\u0131dan almayan zorunlu ve kendinden var bir temelde aran\u0131r.",B.btl,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.b3P,B.aCN)
