B.at4=new A.d("DELIL-0430","Zihin ve Bilin\xe7 Delilleri","Reformed epistemology","Plantinga: B\xfcy\xfck Varl\u0131k Modalitesi","Tanr\u0131 inanc\u0131 b\xfcy\xfck varl\u0131k modalitesi a\xe7\u0131s\u0131ndan rasyonel zemine sahip olabilir.","Alvin Plantinga \xe7izgisinde mesele yaln\u0131z \u201cd\u0131\u015f delil var m\u0131?\u201d de\u011fildir; insan zihninin nas\u0131l g\xfcvenilir inan\xe7 olu\u015fturdu\u011fu da sorulur. B\xfcy\xfck Varl\u0131k Modalitesi ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131, Allah inanc\u0131n\u0131n keyf\xee bir duygu de\u011fil, do\u011fru i\u015fleyen bili\u015fsel yetilerin do\u011fal sonucu olabilece\u011fini g\xf6steren bir kart olarak kullan\u0131labilir.",B.b9K,"orta",B.b6,B.aDF)
