B.aHc=new A.h(u.oZ,u.H,"Bu delil, ak\u0131l y\xfcr\xfctmenin ve mant\u0131k yasalar\u0131n\u0131n fiziksel nesneler gibi ge\xe7ici olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 vurgular. \u0130nsan zihni hakikate ula\u015fabildi\u011fini varsayar; bilim ve felsefe de bu g\xfcven \xfczerine kurulur. E\u011fer ger\xe7eklik b\xfct\xfcn\xfcyle k\xf6r ve ak\u0131ls\u0131z s\xfcre\xe7lerin \xfcr\xfcn\xfc ise, akl\u0131n hakikate uygunlu\u011fu ayr\u0131ca a\xe7\u0131klama ister. Teist a\xe7\u0131klamada ak\u0131l ile evrenin uyumu, her ikisinin de ilim sahibi bir kayna\u011fa dayanmas\u0131yla anlam kazan\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cZihin Delili: Mant\u0131ksal \xc7\u0131kar\u0131m\u0131n Normatifli\u011fi\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: \u0130yi ak\u0131l y\xfcr\xfctme yaln\u0131z fiziksel neden de\u011fil, do\u011fru \xe7\u0131kar\u0131m kural\u0131 ister. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
