B.aAO=new A.h(u.s,u.q,"Bu kart, Risale-i Nur tarz\u0131 tefekk\xfcrde k\xe2inat\u0131n bir kitap, varl\u0131klar\u0131n ise Allah\u2019\u0131n isimlerine ayna olarak okunmas\u0131na dayan\u0131r. \u015euursuz sebeplerin hikmetli, \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc ve faydal\u0131 sonu\xe7lar do\u011furmas\u0131, onlar\u0131 a\u015fan bir ilim ve iradeye i\u015faret eder. Tek bir k\xfc\xe7\xfck varl\u0131k bile g\xfcne\u015f, hava, toprak, su ve kozmik d\xfczenle ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r. Bu ba\u011flant\u0131, par\xe7ay\u0131 yapan\u0131n b\xfct\xfcne h\xfckmeden tek Yarat\u0131c\u0131 olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fi fikrini g\xfc\xe7lendirir. Bu nedenle \u201cK\xe2inat Ayeti: Kutup Ay\u0131s\u0131 Yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: So\u011fuk iklim canl\u0131lar\u0131nda \u0131s\u0131 koruma \xe7\xf6z\xfcmleri dikkat \xe7ekicidir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
